<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Landing' }) %>
<body>
<%- include('partials/nav', { active: 'landing' }) %>

<div class="screen-wrap">
  <div class="screen-label">
    <h2>1  Landing View</h2>
    <span class="tag">Sign-in shell · SSO out of scope for MVP</span>
  </div>
  <div class="device" style="min-height:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
    <div class="wf-navbar">
      <div class="wf-logo"><span class="dot"></span> Campus Lost &amp; Found</div>
      <div class="wf-navlinks"><span>Help</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-grow-1 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
      <div class="box-strong p-4" style="width:380px; border-radius:6px;">
        <div class="kicker mono">DEAKIN SSO</div>
        <div class="lorem-line w-80" style="height:14px;"></div>
        <div class="lorem-line w-60"></div>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <div class="field-wf mb-2">
            <label>Deakin email</label>
            <div class="input-wf">s1234567@deakin.edu.au</div>
          </div>
          <div class="field-wf mb-3">
            <label>Password</label>
            <div class="input-wf">••••••••••</div>
          </div>
          <a href="/browse" class="btn-wf-strong text-center d-block">Continue with Deakin SSO →</a>
          <div class="annot mt-2">Placeholder only  SSO integration is out of MVP scope; this screen exists so the flow has a landing point for later.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-center py-2" style="border-top:1px solid var(--wf-line); font-size:.68rem; color:#8a8f98;">Deakin Students &amp; Staff only</div>
  </div>
  <div class="footnote">Purpose: entry point of the app. No functional auth in MVP  button routes straight to Browse View since SSO doesn't exist yet.</div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
